      "calculationScope": "EXACT_MANUAL_CALCULATION",
      "manualArithmetic": "Source has symbolic relations and a schematic lever, with no assigned numerical exercise. Derive xCM by weighted coordinates and differentiate twice; paired internal forces cancel. Torque z=rx*Fy-ry*Fx and magnitude identity follow from cross product. Reviewer probes only: masses1,3kg at0,4m give xCM=3m; lever arms0.04,0.24m and load10N require muscle60N, equal opposite moments2.4N*m and pivot reaction-50N for force balance, neglecting arm weight explicitly in this probe. Changing pole subtracts shift cross net force, hence cannot change equilibrium when net force is zero.",
